WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:03.170
Miko...

00:05.040 --> 00:06.000
Oh, Miko...

00:13.920 --> 00:14.880
Miko...

00:16.250 --> 00:17.080
Oh, Miko...

00:24.290 --> 00:25.250
Miko...

00:30.630 --> 00:31.580
Oh, Miko...

00:33.080 --> 00:35.080
Oh, Miko, do you hear my call?

00:36.130 --> 00:39.880
I am Takamimi Hime-no-Mikoto.

00:43.580 --> 00:46.830
I stand before you in awe, Takamimi Hime-no-Mikoto.

00:54.880 --> 00:56.960
Your miko is here.

00:57.880 --> 01:02.330
<b>15th Miko of Takamimi Shrine</b>

00:57.880 --> 01:02.330
<b>Koito Koganei (Age 16)</b>

01:04.330 --> 01:05.420
Oh, Miko...

01:06.170 --> 01:11.830
<b>Takamimi Hime-no-Mikoto</b>

01:06.170 --> 01:11.830
<b>Real Name: Eldali Ilma Fanomenel</b>

01:06.170 --> 01:11.830
<b>(Age 621)</b>

01:15.880 --> 01:18.170
Present to me a Red Bull...

01:20.750 --> 01:23.330
Shut-ins don't get energy drinks!

01:23.580 --> 01:29.880
Aw, come on! I stayed up all night gaming, and
tonight there's a marathon of an anime I wanna watch!

01:29.880 --> 01:33.170
I don't care! You said you'd only have
one Redbull a day, right?!

01:33.500 --> 01:35.830
Kikujirou would have no problem giving me one!

01:35.830 --> 01:38.170
I'm not my grandpa, and I'm not giving you one.

01:38.670 --> 01:40.710
You're so strict, Koito...

01:41.540 --> 01:43.290
Ah, I got a rare item!

01:47.790 --> 01:49.670
The goddess enshrined here is Elda...

01:50.380 --> 01:54.420
I took over for my predecessor
and found out that I would become her miko.

01:56.580 --> 01:57.580
<b>Frog Tank</b>

01:57.580 --> 01:58.580
<b>Acrylic Mask</b>

02:00.380 --> 02:01.540
Hopeless.

02:03.210 --> 02:05.380
She is hopeless.

02:06.670 --> 02:10.210
Quit being lazy! Today's a shrine ritual day, you know!

02:10.920 --> 02:13.460
We can do it tomorrow, can't we?

02:13.790 --> 02:17.080
My goddess.... is hopeless.

03:49.170 --> 03:53.790
<b>EPISODE 1</b>

03:49.170 --> 03:53.790
<b>THE ELF</b>

03:49.170 --> 03:53.790
<b>OF TOKYO</b>

03:49.920 --> 03:52.380
Tsukishima, Chuo City, Tokyo.

04:06.210 --> 04:10.040
<b>TAKAMIMI SHRINE</b>

04:06.460 --> 04:11.920
Spanning more than 400 years
since the Edo Period, is Takamimi Shrine.

04:10.040 --> 04:13.500
<b>TAKAMIMI SHRINE</b>

04:12.540 --> 04:16.960
The goddess summoned
from another world enshrined here...

04:17.540 --> 04:20.460
was an absolute social recluse of an elf.

04:21.290 --> 04:26.960
Hey Elda, can you quit doing
that magical power thing? It always startles me.

04:27.290 --> 04:32.380
It's convenient magic that can transmit thoughts
to someone far away by using spirits.

04:32.710 --> 04:36.000
I've never had any divine powers or anything.

04:36.460 --> 04:39.920
In any case, if you yell I'll be able
to hear you in the shrine's office.

04:40.130 --> 04:46.670
I-I'm too embarrassed... I can't yell.
I don't even regularly talk to people.

04:49.420 --> 04:55.290
This is how Elda is, but for some reason, she's popular
with the parishioners, and basically the people in town.

04:56.290 --> 04:58.580
Potato chips from Takahashi on 4th street.

04:59.000 --> 05:01.670
Aburaya dorayaki from Kadoi on 1st street.

05:01.920 --> 05:04.330
Two bottoles of Fonta from Kobayashi at the liquor store.

05:04.580 --> 05:07.250
And from the lady at Shimada Electric...

05:09.920 --> 05:12.210
A V-V...VR set!

05:12.460 --> 05:15.880
I knew Shimaden understood me! I love it!

05:16.460 --> 05:22.960
Originally, the new offerings were things like alcohol,
rice, and special products from the area,

05:23.460 --> 05:28.540
but now, and I don't know why,
the parishioners here offer things that Elda likes.

05:29.080 --> 05:32.670
I think they're spoiling her too much.
I do appreciate it, though.

05:33.040 --> 05:36.460
Thank you... Thank you, Shimaden.

05:36.460 --> 05:37.670
Wow, she's crying.

05:38.420 --> 05:42.080
If it makes her this happy,
Shimada Electric may be fine with it, too.

05:43.080 --> 05:46.290
I-I better put some elbow grease into the shrine ritual!

05:46.460 --> 05:48.250
Yes, exactly! That's the spirit!

05:48.710 --> 05:50.960
I haven't seen her this motivated in a while!

05:51.250 --> 05:54.170
I mean, even though I am an elf with no divine powers.

05:54.170 --> 05:55.210
Don't say that.

05:56.580 --> 05:57.880
So, shall we begin?

05:58.250 --> 06:00.170
We're starting with the purification prayer.

06:03.960 --> 06:09.250
Be there extreme impurities,

06:09.580 --> 06:24.750
may the inner and outer walls of this sacred ground
be clean and pure without hindrance.

06:37.170 --> 06:42.250
Oooh, it feels like the future...
It's like all my dreams are coming true!

06:43.170 --> 06:45.460
Take this seriously, you idiot elf!

06:46.330 --> 06:48.000
I-I couldn't wait any longer!

06:55.750 --> 06:58.790
What's up, Koito? You're looking exhausted.

06:59.710 --> 07:00.830
Koma-chan.

07:02.790 --> 07:05.000
It's that goddess again...

07:05.670 --> 07:10.460
I thought it'd be about Takamimi-sama.
That's all it's been since you became a miko, Koito.

07:10.630 --> 07:13.290
I mean, that elf is just so hopeless.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.040
What's this?

07:15.210 --> 07:19.080
"Elves are individuals with long ears like tree leaves.

07:19.380 --> 07:25.670
They are a mystical clan who are long time magic
wielders, they despise civilization, and love nature."

07:25.790 --> 07:26.710
Is what they say, though.

07:26.830 --> 07:28.500
Yay!

07:29.000 --> 07:33.080
She enjoys civilization to its fullest,
is snooty... and has long ears.

07:33.580 --> 07:36.290
The only thing that applies to her there is her ears.

07:36.670 --> 07:39.130
She stays in her room,
gaming and reading comics and stuff.

07:39.250 --> 07:44.500
"They are also very particular, and they have
an unsociable side that pays no mind to outside worlds."

07:44.630 --> 07:45.790
That part sounds like her.

07:46.210 --> 07:49.880
There wasn't a miko up until me,
and Grandpa's just the type to take care of people.

07:50.210 --> 07:52.460
I had no idea she was this hopeless of a wreck.

07:53.080 --> 07:57.540
But, why is an elf from another world
a goddess in the first place?

07:58.130 --> 08:02.210
Four hundred-something years ago,
my ancestors summoned her.

08:02.500 --> 08:04.250
Seems she's been here ever since.

08:04.500 --> 08:11.920
Hmm. That would mean that she's been adored
by the people of this city for 400 years.

08:12.290 --> 08:16.630
Similarly, I have no clue why,
but I do like Takamimi-sama.

08:18.290 --> 08:20.710
She's not THAT great...

08:21.080 --> 08:24.130
Well, when you've had enough, give me a call.

08:24.750 --> 08:27.330
I'll tell her what's what.

08:28.000 --> 08:30.670
Thanks, pal. That makes me feel better.

08:31.170 --> 08:33.670
Oh yeah! There's something I need to show you!

08:34.710 --> 08:40.170
Ta-da! I bought this with three years worth
of new years' money for my 16th birthday!

08:40.460 --> 08:42.460
Super mature-looking bag, right?!

08:43.580 --> 08:46.630
Mature things just don't suit you, Koito.

08:47.000 --> 08:48.880
I thought so, too...

08:50.130 --> 08:52.080
But you know, in 5 years...

08:52.080 --> 08:59.000
No wait, 3 years from now, I'll get taller, and I'll be curvy
like the Kano sisters, and live rich in Daikanyama,

08:59.210 --> 09:01.960
and I'll become a woman
who looks good with a bag like this!

09:02.170 --> 09:06.210
Yeah, sure. And you want that "Lady in White"
that you admire to see you, right?

09:07.670 --> 09:09.580
Why are you so embarrassed now?

09:09.920 --> 09:13.580
Because... I just remembered her.

09:17.710 --> 09:23.170
Her clothes and her skin were so white,
she was almost transparent, and she was gorgeous.

09:26.500 --> 09:32.130
Yes, I've heard it a hundred times. In elementary school
I went around looking for her with you all the time, right?

09:32.130 --> 09:34.080
Don't take our years of friendship for granted!

09:34.080 --> 09:35.460
I appreciate you doing all that.

09:35.880 --> 09:38.580
But, you still don't even know who she is
or where she's from.

09:38.670 --> 09:41.710
You also don't really remember her face.
We have no clues to follow.

09:41.710 --> 09:44.580
I-I mean, what about using Tweeter or something?

09:45.080 --> 09:48.330
A picture like this would go viral!

09:49.500 --> 09:50.960
It's not that simple to go viral on the Internet.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.130
You're right.

09:52.960 --> 09:55.460
<b>Tsukishima West Central Street First Avenue</b>

09:55.580 --> 09:57.210
Hey, Koito-chan!

09:58.040 --> 09:59.920
You're the new miko, eh?

09:59.920 --> 10:02.460
Yes, I turned 16 the other day.

10:02.460 --> 10:06.750
How wonderful. I'd love to get a glimpse
of Takamimi-sama as well.

10:07.250 --> 10:10.290
Oh, miko-sama. Is Takamimi-sama doing well?

10:10.500 --> 10:13.580
Yes, very well. Thank you so much
for the dorayaki, Kado-chan.

10:14.040 --> 10:17.670
Koito-chan, bring a croquette to Takamimi-sama for me!

10:17.880 --> 10:21.040
I got some nice yellowtail in.
Takamimi-sama likes that, right?

10:21.250 --> 10:22.580
Thank you so much!

10:23.080 --> 10:24.670
Koi-chan, Koi-chan!

10:24.880 --> 10:26.880
Oh, nice to see you out of Shimaden!

10:27.080 --> 10:30.670
Was Elda pleased with my offerings this time around?

10:30.670 --> 10:34.290
Yup, she loved it! But wasn't it expensive?

10:34.540 --> 10:36.040
Are you sure you want her to have it?

10:36.290 --> 10:40.540
If I give someone the hardware,
then they have no choice but to buy the software from us.

10:40.540 --> 10:42.880
Th-that is unexpectedly calculating...

10:43.080 --> 10:51.830
<b>Shimaden</b>

10:43.080 --> 10:51.830
<b>Shimaden</b>

10:43.090 --> 10:51.830
<b>Shimaden</b>

10:43.290 --> 10:45.960
Well, I'm just glad she's happy.

10:46.580 --> 10:51.630
In the past I brought it to the shrine directly, but my
legs ache nowadays so I appreciate what you're doing.

10:52.000 --> 10:58.380
Oh no, she ought to come and greet you. All of
the parishioners really do a lot for Elda and very often,

10:58.580 --> 11:01.460
but all that bum does is stay holed up in her room.

11:01.830 --> 11:05.170
Everyone does this only because they like Elda.

11:05.540 --> 11:10.210
Everyone 'round these parts made a shrine visit
to Elda when they were born.

11:11.080 --> 11:15.920
When you get to be my age,
you start losing your family and friends,

11:16.250 --> 11:19.630
but Elda always stays put in Takamimi Shrine.

11:20.540 --> 11:24.130
It's comforting to know that some things never change.

11:24.920 --> 11:29.420
I suppose so. I can't wait to become an adult...

11:30.960 --> 11:34.210
Look, I bought this bag! It's very mature!

11:34.750 --> 11:39.830
<b>Shimaden</b>

11:34.750 --> 11:39.830
<b>Shimaden</b>

11:34.750 --> 11:39.830
<b>Shimaden</b>

11:35.750 --> 11:37.670
Doesn't quite suit you.

11:37.670 --> 11:39.540
Yeah, I agree.

11:45.580 --> 11:49.000
This tsukudani has a wonderful flavor. Delicious.

11:49.380 --> 11:53.670
She uses her chopsticks nicely.
She's so happy when she's eating.

11:54.710 --> 11:59.000
Similarly, I have no clue why,
but I do like Takamimi-sama.

11:59.290 --> 12:01.960
In the past, I brought it to the shrine directly...

12:02.670 --> 12:03.540
Elda...

12:03.710 --> 12:06.630
I wish she would go meet everyone.

12:06.630 --> 12:09.380
Why is she always by herself?

12:36.040 --> 12:37.170
I'm done...

12:39.330 --> 12:41.290
I'm done!

12:41.580 --> 12:44.330
Wow, this is fun!

12:44.790 --> 12:48.170
Just like I thought... Being alone is a blast!

12:58.830 --> 13:01.000
A..A girl I don't know!

13:01.170 --> 13:02.540
Are you kidding me, Elda?!

13:02.670 --> 13:04.750
You're building plastic models
in the inner sanctuary again?!

13:04.750 --> 13:06.000
It reeks of paint thinner now!

13:06.290 --> 13:09.580
K-Koito, th-there's a girl I don't know here!

13:09.580 --> 13:13.250
Huh? Oh, that's right. This is your first time seeing her.

13:13.880 --> 13:17.170
I'll introduce you. This is my little sister, Koyuzu.

13:17.670 --> 13:19.750
I-I'm Koyuzu Koganei.

13:20.000 --> 13:21.750
L-little sister?

13:22.420 --> 13:27.460
Now that you mention it, I think we met once
when you were a baby. B-but, but!

13:27.710 --> 13:31.170
The only one allowed to see
the Takamimi Hime-no-Mikoto is the miko!

13:31.330 --> 13:33.630
She can't enter the inner sanctuary, can she?!

13:33.960 --> 13:38.380
I'm sorry! I wanted to ask my sister
something about dinner tonight.

13:38.880 --> 13:39.580
Huh?

13:39.670 --> 13:42.830
She wasn't in the shrine office,
so I thought she'd surely be in here, but...

13:43.170 --> 13:44.210
Food?

13:44.670 --> 13:48.630
All the food that you're eating is made entirely by Koyuzu.

13:48.960 --> 13:51.920
Huh? The Hamburg steak from yesterday, too?

13:50.250 --> 13:52.580
<b>Shaped by hand</b>

13:52.080 --> 13:52.920
The Hamburg steak, too.

13:53.130 --> 13:55.080
And yesterday's spicy cod roe pasta?

13:53.130 --> 13:56.330
<b>Homemade sauce</b>

13:55.170 --> 13:56.500
And the spicy cod roe pasta.

13:56.710 --> 14:00.290
And last month's tenderloin
cut wrapped in pastry, Wellington-style?

13:56.880 --> 14:03.170
<b>Super</b>

13:56.880 --> 14:03.170
<b>time-consuming</b>

14:00.460 --> 14:03.080
The tenderloin cut... Eh?! What is that?

14:03.330 --> 14:06.630
The tenderloin cut wrapped
in pastry, Wellington-style, too.

14:07.710 --> 14:08.630
I...

14:09.000 --> 14:11.540
I cannot thank you enough for your hospitality!

14:11.540 --> 14:13.290
Y-you're very welcome!

14:13.830 --> 14:17.380
I'm relieved Elda can show at least a little appreciation.

14:20.460 --> 14:22.210
I got to meet Elda-sama.

14:23.500 --> 14:25.130
You're that happy about it?

14:25.380 --> 14:30.580
Yup. I've always wanted to meet
and talk with her. She's pretty.

14:30.580 --> 14:32.960
I guess, but it's the inside you have to worry about.

14:33.420 --> 14:38.130
How is she so pretty?
I want to ask her next time we meet.

14:42.670 --> 14:45.420
Thanks for the food. Another delicious meal!

14:45.670 --> 14:48.040
It's nothing special. Say...

14:48.250 --> 14:52.040
Why do you look like that, Elda?
You're 600-something years old, right?

14:52.380 --> 14:56.210
Hm? Well, that's because elves are immortal.

14:56.790 --> 15:00.750
We don't have a lifespan like humans do,
and we have eternal life.

15:01.000 --> 15:04.500
Therefore, they say that we are both
an exceedingly beautiful and outstanding specie-

15:04.500 --> 15:06.670
Oh, so you're like a lobster then, huh?

15:04.710 --> 15:07.460
<b>It is said that every time a lobster molts, the outer shell and internal organs</b>

15:06.750 --> 15:09.210
Huh?! Uh... Y-yeah...

15:07.460 --> 15:09.960
<b>are constantly renewed, and it has no life span.</b>

15:10.210 --> 15:15.000
Even though you live so long, it seems backwards
that you want to stay holed up in here.

15:15.130 --> 15:21.920
Oh, that isn't true, I enjoy my solitude. Well, in the past
I did use to walk around more than I do now.

15:22.170 --> 15:25.080
Then why do you stay locked away now?

15:28.000 --> 15:31.420
I-I'm sorry. You don't have to tell me
if it's hard to talk about.

15:31.420 --> 15:32.790
No, it's fine.

15:33.460 --> 15:37.250
I think it's best that you know, as you are my miko.

15:38.290 --> 15:41.380
It's because of something that happened 60 years ago.

15:44.580 --> 15:48.460
A-a neighborhood brat said to me
"What's with the long ears?"!

15:48.580 --> 15:49.960
What's with the long ears?

15:48.670 --> 15:51.380
<b>WHAT'S WITH</b>

15:48.670 --> 15:51.380
<b>THE LONG EARS?</b>

15:54.170 --> 15:57.580
Wait a sec, that's why you're a social recluse?
For 60 years now?

15:57.580 --> 16:00.960
Long ears are the most attractive
part of elves, you know?!

16:01.080 --> 16:05.210
It was that brat on 3rd street
from the Miyamoto shop, Kisaburou!

16:05.210 --> 16:09.460
You're angry about it like it just happened yesterday,
but Kisaburou is already 70 years old!

16:11.830 --> 16:13.670
It's a waste of time worrying about you.

16:13.880 --> 16:15.920
Come on, let's go outside the shrine.

16:16.170 --> 16:19.330
Nope. It's scary out there.
They'll tell me my ears are long.

16:19.920 --> 16:22.330
The granny at Shimaden wanted to see you.

16:22.750 --> 16:30.460
Don't you ever think you want to see
more of the people you like, or go anywhere?

16:30.960 --> 16:36.580
No. I mean, even if I did...

16:39.130 --> 16:40.040
Elda?

16:41.330 --> 16:43.290
N-no more questions!

16:43.290 --> 16:46.000
Koito, I think you're being quite rude towards a goddess!

16:46.000 --> 16:50.250
What?! I think it's way more rude not to show your face
to everyone when they treat you so well!

16:51.000 --> 16:54.830
Well then, I'll put the kotatsu away
and get you out there, even by force!

16:54.830 --> 16:57.670
N-no! Don't destroy my nest!

16:57.670 --> 16:59.290
Don't call it a nest! It's the inner shrine!

16:59.290 --> 17:01.130
S-stop it!

17:04.130 --> 17:05.630
Oh... A..are you o-

17:05.630 --> 17:06.630
I've had it!

17:07.130 --> 17:12.170
Last generation's miko was much kinder than you!
You're not my miko, Koito!

17:13.710 --> 17:16.210
Things were completely different last generation!

17:16.580 --> 17:20.000
And it's not like I want to be a miko for some NEET elf!

17:20.250 --> 17:23.710
I'm gonna get more stylish and be more like "her"!

17:24.330 --> 17:28.460
I want to live in Daikanyama!
And my favorite sweets are macarons!

17:26.130 --> 17:27.750
<b>She's never set foot there.</b>

17:27.750 --> 17:29.290
<b>It's actually sweetened chestnuts</b>

17:32.580 --> 17:36.330
Who even is this "her"?! You're a dummy, Koito!

17:48.290 --> 17:50.790
She's being so selfish.

17:58.580 --> 18:02.540
The place I met her has completely changed as well.

18:26.830 --> 18:28.170
No more tears.

18:32.920 --> 18:36.210
I'll always be by your side.

18:38.500 --> 18:40.670
Why was I even crying then?

18:41.630 --> 18:46.040
Oh, I remember. That was the day of Mom's funeral.

18:46.880 --> 18:50.380
It's comforting to know that some things never change.

18:52.170 --> 18:53.130
That's right.

18:54.330 --> 18:58.790
To an elf that's lived hundreds of years,
things have changed even more drastically.

18:59.540 --> 19:03.380
Sentimental places disappear,
and so do the people you loved.

19:04.420 --> 19:06.080
No. It's scary out there.

19:07.170 --> 19:12.830
Elda... Elda loves everyone, and that's why she's alone!

19:14.630 --> 19:16.460
Koito!

19:17.040 --> 19:19.170
Koito!

19:19.170 --> 19:20.420
E-Elda?!

19:21.000 --> 19:25.880
K-Koito, s-so this is where you were. Thank goodness.

19:28.460 --> 19:30.750
So you can yell.

19:31.540 --> 19:33.630
Look... I came outside!

19:33.880 --> 19:38.210
I-I did it, so c'mon... let's go back!

19:39.290 --> 19:41.080
Did you come looking for me?

19:41.920 --> 19:43.580
You did that much?

19:51.040 --> 19:55.830
Th-this isn't funny!
I... I'm positive I hate being outside now!

19:57.880 --> 20:00.750
Slow down! I know you're in a rush to get home but...

20:00.960 --> 20:02.920
By the way, I didn't know you could move this quickly!

20:03.080 --> 20:05.630
That's too far! Home is this way!

20:07.960 --> 20:10.130
A-ah, you're right.

20:11.000 --> 20:13.330
Things have changed around here, too.

20:14.920 --> 20:15.710
Say...

20:16.540 --> 20:20.250
Elda, why did you become the goddess at our shrine?

20:20.790 --> 20:25.080
I promised a friend that I would, 400 years ago.

20:26.080 --> 20:30.630
He said to watch over Edo
and over this country in his stead.

20:31.540 --> 20:37.460
Oh. I think that friend must have wanted you
to look towards the future, you know?

20:38.500 --> 20:41.710
To a world that will keep turning,
even after they, themselves, are gone.

20:43.580 --> 20:48.330
The world will keep changing,
but that's definitely not a bad thing.

20:49.380 --> 20:50.920
I suppose that's true...

20:52.750 --> 20:54.500
Hey, make a promise with me, too!

20:56.380 --> 21:01.500
Let's take a tour around Tokyo together!
I am your miko, after all!

21:10.250 --> 21:12.670
I-I'll think about it.

21:13.580 --> 21:15.000
Can't you just decide now?

21:16.210 --> 21:19.580
Speaking of, who was that friend? Tell me their name.

21:19.750 --> 21:23.540
Well, his name is Ieyasu Tokugawa-kun.

21:23.540 --> 21:24.670
Oh...

21:25.040 --> 21:25.670
What?

21:26.040 --> 21:27.330
Ieyasu Tokugawa?

21:30.880 --> 21:35.580
I-I'm so sore... Massage my legs, Koito!

21:35.580 --> 21:38.500
Just from going to the park?
I think your muscles are just dead.

21:38.750 --> 21:41.080
Whoa! Your calves are squishy!

21:41.080 --> 21:43.080
Ah, right there.

21:44.000 --> 21:48.080
By the way, you were sure
I was in the park yesterday, huh?

21:48.330 --> 21:50.000
Did you use the spirits to find me?

21:50.420 --> 21:54.210
Well, I did try that, but I couldn't find a single one.

21:54.580 --> 21:57.460
That's why I went to the same place I was ten years ago.

21:57.920 --> 22:01.580
Ten years ago? You've been a recluse for 60 years, right?

22:01.960 --> 22:04.830
No, the last time I went out was ten years ago.

22:05.330 --> 22:08.420
It snowed a ton that day, don't you remember it?

22:08.750 --> 22:09.290
Huh?

22:09.790 --> 22:13.630
You had disappeared and Kikujirou was beside himself.

22:14.080 --> 22:16.580
I had to go find you.

22:16.920 --> 22:19.750
You were crying over there back then, too, Koito.

22:27.790 --> 22:29.210
No more tears.

22:30.750 --> 22:33.880
I'll always be by your side.

22:36.130 --> 22:38.630
Huh? B-but... your voice was-

22:38.750 --> 22:43.630
My voice? Oh, well I was coming down
with a cold that day.

22:43.790 --> 22:47.540
S-so Elda, you really are... the...

22:48.830 --> 22:51.420
No more tears, Koito.

22:53.630 --> 22:56.880
What?! Wait, wait, hold on a second!

22:56.880 --> 22:58.540
What's wrong? You're beet red!

22:58.540 --> 23:00.710
I-I-It's nothing!

23:00.880 --> 23:04.540
Maybe it's okay if I don't go out for fifty more years.

23:04.710 --> 23:08.380
Oh, miko, present to me a Red Bull.

23:08.380 --> 23:12.040
This wreck is my... NOOOO!
